[0.14, "o", "\u001b[1mnothing slips\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(no credentials, no model, no network: real ledger and brief, simulated clock and sources)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.5799999999999998, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;63m== Monday: First sweep of four tools.\u001b[0m\r\n    Brief for Mon 09 Nov: 13 items. Shadow mode, so nothing below was acted on.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Sources (4)\u001b[0m\r\n    github: 3 open\u001b[0m\r\n    todoist: 6 open\u001b[0m\r\n    gmail: 2 open\u001b[0m\r\n    whatsapp: 2 open\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Waiting on you (2)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bdek whatsapp: Priya: are we still on for the supplier call? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-yxfm whatsapp: Sam: contract sent, can you sign by Friday? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    New since the last brief (11)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-dr7k github: Checkout returns 500 when the cart is empty\u001b[0m\r\n    it-un63 github: Refund webhook retries forever\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bhtz github: Review requested: move sessions to Redis\u001b[0m\r\n    it-godg gmail: Landlord: can you confirm the December rent date?\u001b[0m\r\n    it-sobu gmail: Accountant: Q3 receipts are still missing\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bg6y todoist: Renew the acme.dev domain\u001b[0m\r\n    it-f7kz todoist: Pay the accountant\u001b[0m\r\n    it-xe2w todoist: Book the dentist\u001b[0m\r\n    it-t3f3 todoist: Send the October invoice\u001b[0m\r\n    it-w7qs todoist: Fix the backup job\u001b[0m\r\n    it-z3hs todoist: Order new office keys\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[3.7399999999999998, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;63m== Tuesday: #418 was closed. Overnight the Todoist export broke and returned 2 of 6 tasks.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.14, "o", "  \u001b[2malert     \u001b[0m\u001b[31mAlert: connector todoist: its snapshot shrank from 6 to 2 items, so nothing was marked gone. If that's right, run `superagent ledger accept todoist`\u001b[0m\r\n    Brief for Tue 10 Nov: 3 items. Shadow mode, so nothing below was acted on.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Sources (5)\u001b[0m\r\n    ! connector todoist: its snapshot shrank from 6 to 2 items, so nothing was marked gone. If that's right, run `superagent ledger accept todoist`\u001b[0m\r\n    github: 2 open\u001b[0m\r\n    todoist: 6 open\u001b[0m\r\n    gmail: 3 open\u001b[0m\r\n    whatsapp: 2 open\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Waiting on you (2)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bdek whatsapp: Priya: are we still on for the supplier call? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-yxfm whatsapp: Sam: contract sent, can you sign by Friday? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    New since the last brief (1)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-nevj gmail: Supplier: quote expires on Thursday\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.9299999999999997, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;63m== Wednesday: The export is back. You finished one task and deleted another by mistake. The #418 fix was reverted.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
