[3.11, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;63m== Thursday: Nothing changed. This is the day a list quietly goes stale.\u001b[0m\r\n    Brief for Thu 12 Nov: 11 items. Shadow mode, so nothing below was acted on.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Sources (4)\u001b[0m\r\n    github: 3 open\u001b[0m\r\n    todoist: 5 open\u001b[0m\r\n    gmail: 3 open\u001b[0m\r\n    whatsapp: 2 open\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Waiting on you (2)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bdek whatsapp: Priya: are we still on for the supplier call? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-yxfm whatsapp: Sam: contract sent, can you sign by Friday? [waiting]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Gone from their source without a close (1)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-w7qs todoist: Fix the backup job\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    Also open, each shown at least every 3 days (8)\u001b[0m\r\n    it-dr7k github: Checkout returns 500 when the cart is empty [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bhtz github: Review requested: move sessions to Redis [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-bg6y todoist: Renew the acme.dev domain [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-xe2w todoist: Book the dentist [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-t3f3 todoist: Send the October invoice [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-z3hs todoist: Order new office keys [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-godg gmail: Landlord: can you confirm the December rent date? [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n    it-sobu gmail: Accountant: Q3 receipts are still missing [new, 3d]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
